1121..1196 Comment "/// A forged section: the loop arm answers with the field\'s path unchanged,"
1197..1272 Comment "/// typed at the motive at `x`, where the arm owes the motive at `Loop(x)`:"
1273..1350 Comment "/// a path from `Loop(spin(wind(x)))` to `Loop(x)`. The two path types do not"
1351..1387 Comment "/// convert, and the arm is refused."
